# Local work, logs, and secrets.
# work/* keeps jobs and scratch out of git. Public demo metadata is the
# exception: study JSON and attribution are tracked. Stem audio and the FMA
# source mix stay on R2 (see each demo's SHIP.md).
work/*
!work/demo-a-good-bass-for-gambling/
!work/demo-make-funk/
!work/demo-maple-leaf-rag/
